60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Given the evidence, a Meeting Space is the most sustainable option to resolve our logistical and financial inefficiencies. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe the need for a private space to mend our professional relationships is paramount. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"I can't ignore the time we lose and the mess we make, but I'm outnumbered. I'll vote for Option A, the Open Kitchen.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,The financial data is clear: the external hire is a waste of resources that a dedicated room would eliminate. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"While I still harbor concerns about the noise, the cleanliness of our desks is a priority I cannot ignore. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
